      "content": "Thanks for the breakdown. I noticed you put Marcus and Andre in the crime drama category and Julian and Claire in the political thriller. Is that just because of their job titles, or is there a specific vibe you're getting from their backgrounds? Like, do you think the political thriller would feel \"off\" or less believable if I moved Marcus or Andre into those high-level power roles instead?",
